                                "sense_id": "e9b4f091-67cd-3c92-8e6d-d2d6dc350624",
                                "text": "For that blody judge\nAnd mighty sanguisuge,\nThe Pope that is so huge,\nIs ever ther refuge;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb776946-6988-4b42-a2fa-903f852116d4",
                                "sense_id": "e9b4f091-67cd-3c92-8e6d-d2d6dc350624",
                                "text": "Proceede to more manifest diminishing of the humor, by bludletting, cupping, or sanguisuges"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2328a0a4-6e9c-4c1a-a0c4-4349eb05610d",
                                "sense_id": "e9b4f091-67cd-3c92-8e6d-d2d6dc350624",
                                "text": "Can slice a veine, and by the trifid sluce\nOf sanguisuge diminish peccant blood"
